# Both handles usually share the slot at 0x4000C000 (r4's slot = r3's half the
# time, else a random window address); slot -> object at 0x4000C100 (or null);
# generations 0..3 so newer/older/equal all happen.
r3 ptr
r4 ptr
mem32 @r3+0 fixed_or_null 0x4000C000
mem32 @r3+4 len 3
mem32 @r4+0 near @r3+0 0
mem32 @r4+4 len 3
mem32 0x4000C000 fixed_or_null 0x4000C100
mem32 0x4000C104 len 3
